{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:259","content":{"id":259,"title":"41 卫生假说和老朋友","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dfea837b-3971-4671-a108-1fa0e1738f9d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"20 世纪后半叶，发达国家出现的两种有悖常理的趋势："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"94838f94-9a67-47f6-bb5b-c48ef1be2c93","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2a9e62e4-4377-4891-af1f-669022ef7ec3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"97f66fd7-4b97-4b1c-833f-603d89f56875","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"天花、流行性腮腺炎、麻疹、结核等危险传染病得到了有效遏制"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d6dc2e58-c0c3-4ce5-bef0-c2a8276137f5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3d286720-8bc9-4e4f-a97d-72fb7b409d21","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其他一些病发病率不断上升，并且暴涨"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5e547add-5e7e-4edd-bb0b-34012cb74cad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"国家的发达、富裕程度，和过敏或自身免疫性疾病的患病率之间似乎存在某种直接的联系。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f86894c2-d48f-49b7-bf53-4339e3ddfd60","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"卫生假说：人类变得太干净，免疫系统需要经历有害感染才能充分生效。解决方案也很简单，别太干净，别总洗手，多接触微生物，以此训练免疫系统。"}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"3a6ef392-a07e-41aa-95b6-4e79ac889aca","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5682fd30-6e71-4cdc-8e29-4222408bcb1e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不干不净，吃了没病？"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ad0c0c06-fd98-4bfd-bff0-ebaed707b158","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实际情况要复杂和微妙的多，普通大众凭直觉得到的结论，结论不说全错，也是极有问题的。没有考虑到人类免疫系统和周遭微小生物的共同演化。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a63ee4da-ad22-4d45-84b0-68a01063d37e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"保持卫生是预防生病的极重要措施。卫生≠无菌，关键是保持接触多样化的微生物，如果没有获得足够的微生物资料，免疫系统就无法充分学习，出现过激反应，过敏风险就会增加。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1553b986-cd6a-475d-afee-7fcd1827abc4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"剖宫产的问题：在顺产时会和母亲的阴道中、还有粪便中的微生物组亲密接触，是免疫系统适应为什无的第一部。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0ae1a1bc-fc0e-4b20-9969-015bd86d3198","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"母乳喂养少也是影响因素之一，母乳包含丰富多样的物质，可以滋养新生微生物组，滋养多种细菌。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ff3e8449-6d9c-45d0-a344-ab2d1cd2f5df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现代饮食中的纤维大大少于过去，纤维是许多益生菌的重要食粮。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"57f6bfda-e8ee-4183-9529-c22b31cfabbe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"只要人类在长大的地方能接触到更多和人类有多年交情的微生物，免疫系统就能发育的更好。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cf1dc663-c173-4d2a-802b-e2627745e0f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"启发："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"2ab1b8ce-1171-4701-b27e-b885dab5bfd7","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"231d5997-bfc4-458b-bc72-b54fedac25ad","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9c1fc62d-203f-4826-8a07-ea35dbe5eb4e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上完厕所要洗手"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6c4de60b-e404-44ae-ad7a-5da8e7e28c58","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"857b9dca-5898-4e7f-9a3a-6f0c1a291c35","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要打扫房间，但是别消毒"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"40508861-d293-4f8e-ac04-b3fef7eeecf9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"083bb096-5350-4b5b-9a3a-e45b40c3fe12","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"好好清洁厨具"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5bb2f284-2ec8-4f7e-8f59-81d4994ea991","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9700fbb6-69aa-4188-a58a-94501b6148f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"让孩子去森林里玩耍"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第四部分 反叛与内战"},{"label":"41 卫生假说和老朋友","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:259","type":"doc","id":259}}],"prevPage":{"title":"40 自身免疫性疾病","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:258","type":"doc","id":258}},"nextPage":{"title":"42 如何强化免疫系统","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:260","type":"doc","id":260}},"createTime":1741914243991,"updateTime":1743303640538,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640538}}